{"id":"e9a4da37b8e411f7","group":"92","path":"92/92-prop-incompleteness-infinite.md","title":"Infinite Incompleteness","display":"prop-incompleteness-infinite — Infinite Incompleteness","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-prop-incompleteness-infinite","aliases":["92-prop-incompleteness-infinite"],"display":"prop-incompleteness-infinite — Infinite Incompleteness","depends_on":["[[92-thm-essentially-undecidable]]","[[92-df-recursive-axiomatization]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-theory]]","[[92-df-theory-system]]"],"source":"第 V–VII 章关于本质不完备性的背景（PDF 73–110）；本地有限扩张推论","source_status":"本地扩展推论"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-prop-incompleteness-infinite"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-prop-incompleteness-infinite</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-incompleteness-infinite — Infinite Incompleteness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38545b094b915076\" href=\"?note=38545b094b915076\" title=\"92-thm-essentially-undecidable\">92-thm-essentially-undecidable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f9850d6fe4ddc35\" href=\"?note=2f9850d6fe4ddc35\" title=\"92-df-recursive-axiomatization\">92-df-recursive-axiomatization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"87dbd27955ecb3b6\" href=\"?note=87dbd27955ecb3b6\" title=\"92-df-theory\">92-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"09b80989dbe14044\" href=\"?note=09b80989dbe14044\" title=\"92-df-theory-system\">92-df-theory-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V–VII 章关于本质不完备性的背景（PDF 73–110）；本地有限扩张推论"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地扩展推论"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\\)</span> (closed arithmetic theory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\\)</span> (canonical formal-system presentation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"09b80989dbe14044\" href=\"?note=09b80989dbe14044\" title=\"92-df-theory-system\">92-df-theory-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq T\">\\(Q\\subseteq T\\)</span> (extension of Robinson arithmetic)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)\\)</span> (recursive axiomatizability)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T))\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T))\\)</span> (external consistency of the canonical presentation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Indep}_G(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Indep}_G(T)\\)</span> (definition target: undecided-sentence set)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}infinite}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Indep}_G(T)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\mid\n\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\\nvdash\\varphi\\land\n\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi\\},\n\\qquad\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\\land Q\\subseteq T\\land\n\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)\\land\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T))\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow|\\mathrm{Indep}_G(T)|=\\aleph_0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}infinite}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Indep}_G(T)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\mid\n\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\\nvdash\\varphi\\land\n\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi\\},\n\\qquad\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\\land Q\\subseteq T\\land\n\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)\\land\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T))\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow|\\mathrm{Indep}_G(T)|=\\aleph_0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无限不完备性命题</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Indep}_G(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Indep}_G(T)\\)</span> 与归纳模式构造器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_G(C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_G(C)\\)</span> 是不同对象，故采用不同记号</li>\n<li>可证性和一致性都作用于形式系统<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\\)</span>；闭合理论集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>只用作该系统的公理呈现</li>\n<li>若独立句子只有有限多个，就可逐一加入相容的判定并得到相容、递归可公理化的完备扩展，违背本质不完备性</li>\n<li>通过有限多个保持相容的正/负判定反证；并非通过无条件迭代一致性</li>\n<li>句子集本身可数，故“无限”进一步给出基数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span></li>\n<li>这是第一不完备性定理的强化版本</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>若未判定句仅有有限多个，依次选取保持相容的正或负判定并加入；新公理仅有限条，故仍可递归公理化，且之后每个原语言闭句都被判定。它仍含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>，与本质不完备性矛盾。闭句集合可数，遂得到恰为可数无穷多个。</p>\n<p>此论证不使用添加一致性句。仅由普通相容性，不能说逐次添加自身一致性必定产生相容扩张或独立句。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 V–VII 章关于本质不完备性的背景（PDF 73–110）；本地有限扩张推论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-thm-essentially-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"38545b094b915076","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-essentially-undecidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-axiomatization","status":"resolved","id":"2f9850d6fe4ddc35","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-axiomatization]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"87dbd27955ecb3b6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-system","status":"resolved","id":"09b80989dbe14044","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-system","status":"resolved","id":"09b80989dbe14044","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)$ (canonical formal-system presentation, see [[92-df-theory-system]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Indep}_G(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}incompleteness\\text{-}infinite}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Indep}_G(T)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\mid\n\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\\nvdash\\varphi\\land\n\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi\\},\n\\qquad\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\\land Q\\subseteq T\\land\n\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)\\land\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T))\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow|\\mathrm{Indep}_G(T)|=\\aleph_0.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Indep}_G(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_G(C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false}],"bytes":2693,"backlinks":[{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-prop-incompleteness-infinite]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-341","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-prop-incompleteness-infinite]]"}],"outgoing":["38545b094b915076","2f9850d6fe4ddc35","468d35690d25ee42","c7befd96bd551ade","90f32e29c9d553ed","87dbd27955ecb3b6","09b80989dbe14044"]}